docs/consistency-failures.md

# === Build Output ===
# Anchored to the repo root (ADR-0009 s2). No build/ or builds/ rule at all:
# with core.ignorecase (Windows) even an anchored /build/ hides Unreal's Build/
# folder (UAT/Gauntlet scripts, platform build settings).
/bin/
/obj/
/out/
/dist/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.app

# === Engine: Unreal ===
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/
# Local safety copies (ADR-0009 s2): keep on disk, never commit
_snapshots/
_backup_pre_rebase/
# Textures extracted by FBX import (regenerated on import)
*.fbm/
